  "description": "Unlock the power of AI with Private AI Chat, the ultimate app for secure and private conversations with LLMs. The app brings the cutting-edge AI directly to your device, ensuring your chats remain confidential and offline.\n\nKey Features:\n- Offline Chatting: Interact with advanced AI models directly on your device without the need for an internet connection.\n- Hugging Face Integration: Search for GGUFs on Hugging Face directly within the app, bookmark or download your favorites.\n- Secure & Private: Your data never leaves your device. All conversations are processed locally, providing security and peace of mind.\n\nHow It Works:\n- Download & Install: Get the app from the App Store and install it on your device.\n- Download Model Weights: Connect to the internet to download the required model weights (in GGUF format, e.g., from Hugging Face).\n- Chat Offline: Once setup is complete, enjoy private, offline conversations with the model anytime, anywhere.",
